    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/cfaa264fe8e20e7f4836389b12d29375.poster.avif?t=1750687556\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/cfaa264fe8e20e7f4836389b12d29375.webm?t=1750687556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/cfaa264fe8e20e7f4836389b12d29375.mp4?t=1750687556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/4f22d750fee5ac123c9e236201cea0f1.poster.avif?t=1750687556\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/4f22d750fee5ac123c9e236201cea0f1.webm?t=1750687556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/4f22d750fee5ac123c9e236201cea0f1.mp4?t=1750687556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mentor, like family, has been murdered.<br>Her last words\u2014<strong>&quot;Kill La.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As \u2018Valhalla,\u2019 you must uncover the true <strong>\u2018La\u2019</strong> who killed your mentor and take revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Mysterious Island That Grants Wishes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/2ed53a411a8b40a91e58094277e9b3a0.poster.avif?t=1750687556\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/2ed53a411a8b40a91e58094277e9b3a0.webm?t=1750687556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/2ed53a411a8b40a91e58094277e9b3a0.mp4?t=1750687556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chasing the clues behind your mentor\u2019s death, you arrive at a peculiar island.<br>Everyone here has followed an <strong>&quot;invitation that grants wishes.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/fbc75f370220de21ed95fd8905ab4791.poster.avif?t=1750687556\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/fbc75f370220de21ed95fd8905ab4791.webm?t=1750687556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/fbc75f370220de21ed95fd8905ab4791.mp4?t=1750687556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this island has only one rule:<br>\u203b <strong>Never wander at night.</strong> \u203b<br>Uncover the hidden truth of this island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deduce Within Delusions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/ec5f1a651037f2d38ee0ec555fa0f7e3.poster.avif?t=1750687556\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/ec5f1a651037f2d38ee0ec555fa0f7e3.webm?t=1750687556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/ec5f1a651037f2d38ee0ec555fa0f7e3.mp4?t=1750687556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through <strong>\u2018Resonance,\u2019</strong> you can enter the memories of suspects.<br>Observe their past and extract the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/a8a99344e7f28e0a437f7e5efe068942.poster.avif?t=1750687556\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/a8a99344e7f28e0a437f7e5efe068942.webm?t=1750687556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/a8a99344e7f28e0a437f7e5efe068942.mp4?t=1750687556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the clues you\u2019ve gathered <strong>within dreams</strong><br>and find the true culprit behind your mentor\u2019s murder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Brutal Yet Beautiful Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/6db9f3255bb91d203ff0809acc148403.avif?t=1750687556\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Converse with <strong>eight \u2018La\u2019s\u2019</strong>, build rapport, and gain their trust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/40e6ae96d981a18d6a0d93feb6dc223a.poster.avif?t=1750687556\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/40e6ae96d981a18d6a0d93feb6dc223a.webm?t=1750687556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/40e6ae96d981a18d6a0d93feb6dc223a.mp4?t=1750687556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>But never forget\u2014<strong>they cannot be trusted.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude78 <strong>Your goal is singular\u2014revenge.</strong><br>Find the real \u2018La\u2019 and decide how this story ends.</p>",
