type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through <strong>\u2018Resonance,\u2019</strong> you can enter the memories of suspects.<br>Observe their past and extract the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/a8a99344e7f28e0a437f7e5efe068942.poster.avif?t=1750687556\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/a8a99344e7f28e0a437f7e5efe068942.webm?t=1750687556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/a8a99344e7f28e0a437f7e5efe068942.mp4?t=1750687556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the clues you\u2019ve gathered <strong>within dreams</strong><br>and find the true culprit behind your mentor\u2019s murder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Brutal Yet Beautiful Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/6db9f3255bb91d203ff0809acc148403.avif?t=1750687556\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Converse with <strong>eight \u2018La\u2019s\u2019</strong>, build rapport, and gain their trust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/40e6ae96d981a18d6a0d93feb6dc223a.poster.avif?t=1750687556\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524200/extras/40e6ae96d981a18d6a0d93feb6dc223a.webm?t=1750687556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/252